WEBVTT

00:00:14.350 --> 00:00:16.740
Prince...

00:00:14.900 --> 00:00:16.930
Episode 8

00:00:21.940 --> 00:00:23.330
Look at me

00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:27.160
Take a good look!

00:00:39.350 --> 00:00:40.590
Your eyes...

00:00:43.480 --> 00:00:44.860
This look...

00:00:50.630 --> 00:00:52.070
I hate it to death

00:00:52.070 --> 00:00:56.610
So... don't you dare look at me like that again

00:00:58.760 --> 00:01:00.920
How am I looking at you?

00:01:00.920 --> 00:01:03.450
I've never looked at you any differently

00:01:03.450 --> 00:01:06.460
You feel sorry. Pity for me!

00:01:08.470 --> 00:01:11.230
Did you think I'd be grateful for this?

00:01:12.060 --> 00:01:15.180
Do you know how I feel
seeing the sympathy of people like you?!

00:01:30.120 --> 00:01:31.720
Stay out of my sight

00:01:33.560 --> 00:01:38.470
Next time... I don't know what I'll do

00:02:06.350 --> 00:02:16.350
Project coordinator, translator and type setter: Nemie

00:02:16.450 --> 00:02:26.450
Beta Editor: Sana

00:02:26.550 --> 00:02:31.550
Consulting translators: mozgocluv, Teo

00:02:29.200 --> 00:02:32.360
Sorry I couldn't stop it

00:02:34.100 --> 00:02:36.920
Eun is very sorry, so don't be angry

00:02:37.920 --> 00:02:39.630
I noticed that you weren't looking at me

00:02:40.230 --> 00:02:41.310
What?

00:02:42.300 --> 00:02:46.730
Why did you close your eyes instead of enjoying my view?

00:02:49.140 --> 00:02:51.190
Thought you wouldn't like this

00:02:51.190 --> 00:02:52.730
Have I offended you?

00:02:56.590 --> 00:02:59.380
No wonder they say that human feelings are a complex thing.

00:03:00.850 --> 00:03:05.000
I was upset with the person who was watching and with the person who wasn't watching.

00:03:08.010 --> 00:03:10.450
I can't understand my feelings

00:03:14.100 --> 00:03:17.210
Either way, look straight at me

00:03:18.010 --> 00:03:19.760
I want you to do this

00:03:20.400 --> 00:03:21.510
Okay

00:03:25.270 --> 00:03:27.010
About Hae Soo...

00:03:27.890 --> 00:03:29.590
I think Yo influenced her

00:03:29.590 --> 00:03:31.090
Don't mention it

00:03:32.010 --> 00:03:33.230
I don't want to hear

00:03:50.900 --> 00:03:53.470
I see you have already become a part of Damiwon

00:03:54.280 --> 00:03:56.070
All thanks to you, Your Majesty

00:03:57.250 --> 00:04:00.400
I guess you're still on good terms with the princes

00:04:01.950 --> 00:04:05.490
I can't meet them as often as before

00:04:06.490 --> 00:04:08.750
You're getting smarter

00:04:08.750 --> 00:04:10.310
You know your place

00:04:12.600 --> 00:04:14.910
It's time to comb the emperor's hair

00:04:53.280 --> 00:04:55.420
Empress Yu has arrived

00:05:01.630 --> 00:05:02.930
I myself

00:05:13.280 --> 00:05:17.120
Did you want to use this insignificant hairpin?

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:20.870
There is a severe drought outside.
I asked her to dress me simpler

00:05:35.950 --> 00:05:37.540
This is Chinese wormwood tea

00:05:37.540 --> 00:05:38.800
Thank you

00:05:47.330 --> 00:05:48.720
White tea

00:05:48.720 --> 00:05:49.790
Thank you

00:05:49.790 --> 00:05:52.290
Is this pear juice?

00:05:52.290 --> 00:05:54.700
My beloved, Su

00:05:54.700 --> 00:05:56.700
And I love green tea

00:05:56.700 --> 00:06:00.380
The sister prepared everyone his favorite drink

00:06:00.380 --> 00:06:03.490
As long as you enjoy, I don't need more

00:06:11.450 --> 00:06:13.570
- Fresh loose leaf tea
- Take it away

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:15.340
No time for tea

00:06:16.830 --> 00:06:19.490
- What?
- What kind of tea during drought?

00:06:22.110 --> 00:06:23.640
The 4th Prince is right

00:06:23.990 --> 00:06:27.300
The country has been in drought since last winter

00:06:27.300 --> 00:06:29.630
Residents pray to Heaven

00:06:29.630 --> 00:06:33.160
We must live simply and exercise restraint

00:06:35.630 --> 00:06:38.170
Are you sure you've completed my assignment?

00:06:38.170 --> 00:06:39.270
Got it figured out

00:06:39.270 --> 00:06:41.690
The 4th Prince's favorite drink is fresh loose leaf tea.

00:06:41.690 --> 00:06:42.730
Loves butter and honey sweets

00:06:42.730 --> 00:06:44.830
- Exactly?
- I'm telling you, yes.

00:06:44.830 --> 00:06:48.720
You didn't want it to seem obvious, so I asked everyone individually.

00:06:48.720 --> 00:06:51.920
But why didn't he even touch it?

00:06:51.920 --> 00:06:55.050
I'm illiterate, but I worked so hard to learn how to do it.

00:06:55.050 --> 00:06:57.080
Then ask him yourself

00:06:57.080 --> 00:06:59.790
Ask what you need to do to calm his anger

00:07:00.570 --> 00:07:03.060
To ask him, I need him to look at me

00:07:03.060 --> 00:07:06.560
Looks like he's gotten closer to the others

00:07:06.560 --> 00:07:09.100
- Why does he behave like this with me?
- It's true

00:07:09.910 --> 00:07:13.810
He immediately forgave our 10th brother

00:07:13.810 --> 00:07:16.250
Are you and your brother So...

00:07:16.250 --> 00:07:18.440
Yes, I will do as you told me

00:07:20.340 --> 00:07:22.500
What? Are you leaving already?

00:07:24.420 --> 00:07:27.120
W...what are you doing?

00:07:27.120 --> 00:07:30.410
Why are you beautiful even then
when you look at me angrily?

00:07:30.410 --> 00:07:31.800
Are you crazy?

00:07:34.770 --> 00:07:37.870
This is a punishment for not being able to please the 4th brother.

00:07:39.050 --> 00:07:40.140
Okay, Su

00:07:40.140 --> 00:07:41.950
See you again

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:45.310
Oh, go ahead

00:07:46.740 --> 00:07:49.710
The killer wants to kill me

00:07:51.440 --> 00:07:54.170
The prince went too far with his jokes, didn't he?

00:07:54.560 --> 00:07:56.020
God

00:07:56.020 --> 00:07:58.580
I'm sorry, I'm very sorry

00:07:59.880 --> 00:08:01.670
What's going on here?!

00:08:10.160 --> 00:08:11.500
"Xin Xiu Ben Cao"

00:08:11.500 --> 00:08:15.600
This book contains more than 100 medicines

00:08:16.540 --> 00:08:17.810
"Ben Cao Shi Yi"

00:08:17.810 --> 00:08:22.030
This is a book about medicinal plants,
written by Chen Cang Qi of the Tang Dynasty

00:08:22.030 --> 00:08:24.270
I've already read them!

00:08:24.640 --> 00:08:25.810
Is it true?

00:08:25.810 --> 00:08:28.220
Then I'll give you even more books

00:08:30.100 --> 00:08:32.720
For four hours you will think about what you did wrong.

00:08:38.250 --> 00:08:40.230
It's all your fault

00:08:40.890 --> 00:08:41.950
What?

00:08:43.080 --> 00:08:46.440
The problem is that a simple maid is close to princes

00:08:46.990 --> 00:08:50.410
Don't talk to princes anymore or even look at them

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.480
Then you won't suffer

00:08:53.480 --> 00:08:57.370
I knew the princes even before I entered the palace

00:08:57.370 --> 00:09:01.000
I didn’t flirt or seduce, as others think!

00:09:01.000 --> 00:09:04.230
You're wrong if you think you can't end a relationship.

00:09:04.760 --> 00:09:06.640
Look at the wound on your hand

00:09:06.640 --> 00:09:09.040
You broke off relations with the ruler with one cut

00:09:10.900 --> 00:09:13.830
I don't want Damiwon to be in chaos because of you.

00:09:14.790 --> 00:09:16.510
Stay away from princes

00:09:18.960 --> 00:09:19.960
Okay

00:09:26.980 --> 00:09:31.060
By the way, why do you only eat oatmeal?

00:09:31.900 --> 00:09:35.230
I've never seen you eat normally

00:09:35.230 --> 00:09:37.560
If I eat food with seasonings,

00:09:37.560 --> 00:09:39.880
it will be difficult to distinguish the aromas of tea

00:09:44.070 --> 00:09:45.520
Hold it properly!

00:10:04.840 --> 00:10:07.050
No food due to drought

00:10:07.050 --> 00:10:09.250
No fun!

00:10:12.690 --> 00:10:14.690
Scared me!

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:18.880
That girl with the bear?

00:10:18.880 --> 00:10:21.530
Why are you here again?

00:10:23.050 --> 00:10:25.240
I...

00:10:26.890 --> 00:10:28.270
I...

00:10:30.730 --> 00:10:34.090
- I just...
- What, what, what?

00:10:34.090 --> 00:10:36.910
As if you know what you can do for fun here?

00:10:54.980 --> 00:10:57.120
When will he come?

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:04.430
Well, soon already?

00:11:07.260 --> 00:11:09.980
Forget!
How long should I wait...

00:11:19.270 --> 00:11:24.580
I'm standing in front of you again, standing here alone

00:11:24.580 --> 00:11:27.750
Tell me with your lips

00:11:27.750 --> 00:11:30.290
Only "yes", only "yes"

00:11:30.290 --> 00:11:34.860
I don’t understand why, but I always rush to you

00:11:35.160 --> 00:11:40.460
With a breath of wind I will tell you: I love

00:11:36.900 --> 00:11:39.220
Got it! I caught it!

00:11:44.190 --> 00:11:46.370
Need you

00:11:45.490 --> 00:11:47.970
Did you see it? I caught him!

00:11:48.570 --> 00:11:51.620
So, now let's cook and eat?

00:11:48.610 --> 00:11:52.140
My dear, so to speak I want

00:11:52.140 --> 00:11:55.410
What I can’t say

00:11:55.610 --> 00:12:02.590
My dear, my dear, my dear: I love you!

00:12:03.890 --> 00:12:05.460
How much more to catch?

00:12:07.020 --> 00:12:08.530
U... killer!

00:12:08.530 --> 00:12:11.130
How could you break this baby's neck?

00:12:11.130 --> 00:12:12.810
And are you a man?

00:12:17.910 --> 00:12:20.440
Did you want to eat it alive?

00:12:26.040 --> 00:12:27.050
Hey

00:12:37.120 --> 00:12:38.290
Lit

00:12:39.530 --> 00:12:41.080
Already burned out

00:12:43.580 --> 00:12:46.990
What man can't even catch a bird?

00:12:46.990 --> 00:12:48.410
What is its use?

00:12:49.270 --> 00:12:51.000
I can catch them

00:12:51.890 --> 00:12:55.070
Then how will he protect his wife and children?

00:12:55.940 --> 00:12:57.610
I can protect us

00:12:57.610 --> 00:12:58.800
God

00:13:01.920 --> 00:13:06.300
I don’t think you’ll change your decision, right?

00:13:08.700 --> 00:13:10.980
I only have one way

00:13:10.980 --> 00:13:13.460
God... what?

00:13:13.960 --> 00:13:18.060
Hey! That's why I taught you to fight,
to attack me because of a guy?

00:13:18.060 --> 00:13:21.560
God... okay, okay

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:23.180
Do what you want

00:13:35.130 --> 00:13:37.400
We will perform a rain ritual

00:13:38.030 --> 00:13:41.520
For now, stay away from Damiwon

00:14:16.830 --> 00:14:19.000
"Yuk Hyul"?

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:25.210
"Yuk" as in "wash", "Höl" as in hole

00:14:45.720 --> 00:14:46.910
Your Highness

00:14:48.310 --> 00:14:49.510
Su!

00:14:50.370 --> 00:14:52.890
How could I forget about this place?

00:14:52.890 --> 00:14:54.300
Chae Ryung told me about him

00:14:54.300 --> 00:14:56.470
I told her I was upset
because I can't see you

00:14:56.470 --> 00:14:59.340
How did this place even come to be?

00:15:00.100 --> 00:15:03.310
I'm lucky it exists

00:15:09.420 --> 00:15:11.660
If you leave here, you will leave the palace

00:15:12.410 --> 00:15:14.010
Don't you want to leave?

00:15:17.190 --> 00:15:18.610
It's true

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:21.360
You only need to take a few steps

00:15:23.000 --> 00:15:27.010
I miss Chae Ryung, I want to go to the market

00:15:27.430 --> 00:15:29.950
And I don’t mind seeing my sister

00:15:31.980 --> 00:15:36.330
The 4th Prince told me something when I entered the palace

00:15:37.100 --> 00:15:40.790
No matter where I run, I will still remain in the hands of the emperor.

00:15:41.260 --> 00:15:45.310
There's nowhere in Goryeo that I can escape the emperor's eyes.

00:15:49.020 --> 00:15:50.050
That's right

00:15:51.500 --> 00:15:54.210
There is no place where his power is invalid

00:15:58.380 --> 00:16:01.220
Damiwon suits me very well

00:16:03.180 --> 00:16:06.940
Until the time comes
officially leave the palace,

00:16:08.140 --> 00:16:10.060
I will work and live well

00:16:12.010 --> 00:16:13.740
Until then...

00:16:15.450 --> 00:16:17.170
can you not forget me?

00:16:24.360 --> 00:16:27.680
Soon there will be a ritual of rain

00:16:30.370 --> 00:16:34.610
If it rains, the emperor will perform any favor as a gift.

00:16:35.900 --> 00:16:39.040
Can forgive a criminal or approve a marriage

00:16:39.510 --> 00:16:41.650
Or throw a feast for the elderly

00:16:42.230 --> 00:16:43.290
Also

00:16:45.640 --> 00:16:47.450
may allow court servants to leave the palace

00:16:48.520 --> 00:16:49.600
Clear

00:16:52.300 --> 00:16:53.350
What?

00:16:54.550 --> 00:16:55.960
Leave?

00:16:57.630 --> 00:17:02.250
If it rains I will ask for you

00:17:04.180 --> 00:17:06.860
So I can come back to your house again?

00:17:11.380 --> 00:17:12.480
Then

00:17:13.360 --> 00:17:15.450
I will find all the medicinal herbs in Songak

00:17:15.450 --> 00:17:17.770
and buy those from which you can make soap

00:17:17.770 --> 00:17:19.600
I'll fill the whole house with them

00:17:22.380 --> 00:17:25.590
Chae Ryung and Princess Yeon Hwa will complain

00:17:29.450 --> 00:17:31.890
It would be nice if it rained

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:36.850
He must go

00:17:40.640 --> 00:17:41.710
Yes

00:17:43.100 --> 00:17:44.220
Must

00:17:50.260 --> 00:17:56.900
I want to love you like my last love

00:17:57.790 --> 00:18:04.780
If only everything were like this, then life would be happy

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:13.860
I will give my heart completely

00:18:13.860 --> 00:18:23.560
If you can stay with me for the rest of your life

00:18:25.100 --> 00:18:28.790
You should not comb yourself, but remember not to use cold water

00:18:28.790 --> 00:18:31.360
I'm going to catch a group of thieves that appeared after the drought

00:18:31.360 --> 00:18:33.650
Can I wash myself later?

00:18:33.650 --> 00:18:36.250
Ms. Su, I'm sure you know

00:18:37.470 --> 00:18:39.500
Gotta keep your mouth shut

00:18:39.500 --> 00:18:41.240
Of course

00:18:41.240 --> 00:18:43.790
I'll be invisible, don't worry

00:18:44.810 --> 00:18:47.920
I left the necklace in your room on the table

00:18:47.920 --> 00:18:49.760
This is in exchange for your help

00:18:49.760 --> 00:18:52.390
Thank you

00:18:59.510 --> 00:19:01.160
We're ready to go

00:19:01.160 --> 00:19:02.680
Okay, let's go

00:19:28.190 --> 00:19:30.840
What is it? Let me go!

00:19:30.840 --> 00:19:33.350
Where are you taking me? Let go!

00:19:38.870 --> 00:19:40.380
Y-Your Majesty...

00:19:43.620 --> 00:19:45.480
Where have you been?

00:19:46.480 --> 00:19:50.580
I was running an errand

00:19:50.580 --> 00:19:52.520
You were with the crown prince

00:19:53.900 --> 00:19:56.900
I said goodbye to the Crown Prince before he left to quell the uprising.

00:19:56.900 --> 00:20:00.660
Why did you carry something with you?
just wanted to say goodbye?

00:20:01.280 --> 00:20:02.350
This...

00:20:03.820 --> 00:20:06.810
These are precious things that cannot be found outside of Damiwon

00:20:09.270 --> 00:20:12.750
Did the Crown Prince ask you to bring them?

00:20:12.750 --> 00:20:13.980
Everything is wrong!

00:20:14.660 --> 00:20:18.060
I was assigned to go to a place, but I stopped to see the Crown Prince

00:20:18.060 --> 00:20:21.500
Then what do you need these precious medicines for?

00:20:26.530 --> 00:20:29.820
Perhaps the Crown Prince is ill?

00:20:30.910 --> 00:20:32.010
What?

00:20:34.670 --> 00:20:38.060
I don't know anything

00:20:39.440 --> 00:20:40.640
Don't know?

00:20:45.200 --> 00:20:46.780
Do you dare test me?

00:20:47.360 --> 00:20:48.790
Let her go

00:20:54.690 --> 00:20:58.290
She returns from the palace
Jeongdeokjeong on my orders

00:20:59.170 --> 00:21:00.550
Jeondeokjeong?

00:21:02.840 --> 00:21:04.110
Concubine Oh,

00:21:05.110 --> 00:21:06.930
are you making fun of me?

00:21:06.930 --> 00:21:10.050
His Majesty injured his knees due to the ritual

00:21:10.050 --> 00:21:11.940
I sent her to deliver the ointment

00:21:13.030 --> 00:21:16.120
Don't talk about the emperor - Damiwon's law

00:21:16.120 --> 00:21:20.410
I just want to let you know that this won't happen again.

00:21:22.540 --> 00:21:24.340
Why her?

00:21:24.870 --> 00:21:28.950
She hasn't been in Damiwon for long, and you sent her?

00:21:32.360 --> 00:21:35.080
Then...should I have gone?

00:21:36.040 --> 00:21:37.100
What?

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:41.450
I asked, would you prefer that I go to the emperor?

00:21:43.440 --> 00:21:46.430
Then there wouldn't be any misunderstandings?

00:21:55.470 --> 00:21:58.970
As the Emperor commanded, I rule Damiwon.

00:21:58.970 --> 00:22:02.840
I'll punish this girl myself

00:22:26.950 --> 00:22:28.170
What brought you here?

00:22:28.200 --> 00:22:29.530
You can relax

00:22:29.950 --> 00:22:31.810
I won't be long

00:22:32.210 --> 00:22:34.760
I don't have time, get out

00:22:35.550 --> 00:22:36.670
Why?

00:22:36.670 --> 00:22:39.980
Do you think I killed someone again?

00:22:41.350 --> 00:22:44.200
No I don't think so

00:22:44.200 --> 00:22:48.150
Today you don't smell like blood, but like a monster.

00:22:49.890 --> 00:22:51.260
Say what you want

00:22:53.550 --> 00:22:58.200
No matter how much you hate the concubine Oh,
you must maintain your dignity

00:22:59.700 --> 00:23:03.300
If you make a noise in Damiwon, people will start spreading rumors,

00:23:03.300 --> 00:23:05.520
that you can't put a girl in her place

00:23:06.370 --> 00:23:09.720
They will say that having a son like me is karma

00:23:10.620 --> 00:23:11.260
What?

00:23:11.260 --> 00:23:12.980
So please respect yourself

00:23:13.480 --> 00:23:16.810
And stop blaming innocent people

00:23:16.810 --> 00:23:18.870
We shouldn't talk to you like that, should we?

00:23:19.370 --> 00:23:20.550
Well...

00:23:24.970 --> 00:23:26.650
The bastard is crazy

00:23:34.570 --> 00:23:36.260
Really...

00:23:37.350 --> 00:23:39.810
All this because of that girl?

00:23:46.220 --> 00:23:47.650
Concubine Oh!

00:23:49.530 --> 00:23:52.750
Thank you. In fact...

00:23:55.200 --> 00:23:57.530
I told you to stay away from the crown prince.

00:23:58.460 --> 00:24:00.570
Your arrogance has no end

00:24:01.810 --> 00:24:04.000
I shouldn't have accepted you

00:24:04.720 --> 00:24:05.970
I'm sorry

00:24:09.440 --> 00:24:10.750
Concubine!

00:24:13.410 --> 00:24:18.100
What... what did I do wrong?

00:24:19.360 --> 00:24:21.590
You make your own medicine

00:24:21.590 --> 00:24:24.360
Is there any difference if I do the same, but for the crown prince?

00:24:25.020 --> 00:24:28.270
I know how to help him, why are you asking me to ignore his illness?

00:24:28.270 --> 00:24:31.470
You lecture me and punish me more than others

00:24:31.500 --> 00:24:33.930
I just can’t understand why?

00:24:33.930 --> 00:24:35.710
You don't know the palace

00:24:35.710 --> 00:24:38.480
- You don’t know at all
- Yes, I don’t know

00:24:38.480 --> 00:24:40.570
Why don't you introduce him?

00:24:40.570 --> 00:24:44.510
I... feel like it's unfair

00:24:45.900 --> 00:24:48.370
I always work hard, try to cope

00:24:48.370 --> 00:24:50.490
Why do you hate me so much?

00:24:50.490 --> 00:24:53.030
I'm so hurt, I'm disappointed, you treat me badly!

00:24:53.030 --> 00:24:55.230
Because I look at you and remember myself!

00:24:58.000 --> 00:24:59.290
You trust people

00:24:59.290 --> 00:25:01.570
trying to be good
there's not an iota of fear in you

00:25:02.210 --> 00:25:04.930
Such girls have no place in the palace

00:25:04.930 --> 00:25:07.660
They can easily die

00:25:08.040 --> 00:25:09.510
I'm so worried...

00:25:15.070 --> 00:25:17.190
Concubine! Concubine!

00:25:17.190 --> 00:25:18.620
Are you okay, concubine?!

00:25:18.620 --> 00:25:21.650
Concubine! Concubine, please wake up!

00:25:22.030 --> 00:25:24.710
Concubine! Concubine!

00:25:44.720 --> 00:25:46.360
Are you feeling better now?

00:25:47.460 --> 00:25:49.010
What's happened?

00:25:49.740 --> 00:25:53.220
Have you had stomach pains?
because of them you lost consciousness

00:25:53.220 --> 00:25:56.460
A doctor from Jeongdeokjeong secretly examined you

00:25:56.460 --> 00:25:57.660
Yes?

00:25:59.010 --> 00:26:02.560
Nobody else knows?

00:26:02.560 --> 00:26:03.870
Don't worry

00:26:05.140 --> 00:26:09.510
I'll keep everything a secret
if you eat porridge to replenish your strength

00:26:11.470 --> 00:26:12.930
Cedar porridge

00:26:12.930 --> 00:26:15.150
The doctor said that you can eat it

00:26:16.060 --> 00:26:17.790
I'm fine, you can go

00:26:17.790 --> 00:26:20.260
I'll wait until you eat it all

00:26:20.260 --> 00:26:22.080
Don't be stubborn, leave her and go

00:26:22.080 --> 00:26:24.410
Words like that won't help

00:26:24.990 --> 00:26:26.070
What?

00:26:26.930 --> 00:26:30.800
I know why you treated me this way

00:26:33.440 --> 00:26:37.510
Were you afraid that I would make a deadly mistake?

00:26:38.630 --> 00:26:41.510
You saw how I cut my hand

00:26:46.580 --> 00:26:49.310
Say I'm like you

00:26:49.310 --> 00:26:53.670
I'll be very, very careful, just like you

00:26:53.670 --> 00:26:55.580
Then I will live well

00:26:56.810 --> 00:27:01.620
And you, please, learn to accept care from others when you are sick

00:27:02.900 --> 00:27:04.370
It's quite normal

00:27:10.820 --> 00:27:12.500
Eat

00:27:12.500 --> 00:27:15.030
My hand hurts from chopping nuts

00:27:26.670 --> 00:27:28.200
And this is porridge?

00:27:53.150 --> 00:27:57.200
People ask for a rain ritual,

00:27:57.950 --> 00:28:00.700
but my body doesn't listen to me

00:28:00.900 --> 00:28:03.870
You won't be able to return to your previous form.

00:28:05.980 --> 00:28:09.000
Your Majesty, why not choose one of the princes?

00:28:09.600 --> 00:28:12.370
If the one whose energy is filled with water leads the ritual,

00:28:12.370 --> 00:28:14.590
people will feel calm

00:28:16.760 --> 00:28:19.250
His Highness Wang Won

00:28:19.250 --> 00:28:21.820
Was born in the year of the dog

00:28:21.820 --> 00:28:23.780
That's right, exactly

00:28:23.780 --> 00:28:25.620
And what is all this for?

00:28:31.340 --> 00:28:34.400
- Chi Mon, can you cross me out?
- What?

00:28:34.400 --> 00:28:37.060
I don't like to participate in this kind of thing

00:28:37.060 --> 00:28:40.950
What if I get elected and people don't like me?

00:28:42.410 --> 00:28:43.760
It's scary to imagine

00:28:44.800 --> 00:28:47.300
Eun, is life always easy?

00:28:47.620 --> 00:28:50.440
It doesn't matter who gets elected, what matters is the rain

00:28:51.980 --> 00:28:54.920
Brother, what will happen if it doesn't rain?

00:28:54.920 --> 00:28:56.480
You will die

00:28:56.730 --> 00:28:57.930
Will I die?

00:28:58.700 --> 00:29:02.250
Before the founding of our state, people themselves killed the ruler

00:29:02.250 --> 00:29:04.860
This was explained by the fact that his blood called for the beginning of rain

00:29:05.830 --> 00:29:08.390
Chi Mon! Remove my name!

00:29:08.900 --> 00:29:13.740
I'm sure no one will kill you

00:29:13.740 --> 00:29:15.310
If brother is right...

00:29:15.960 --> 00:29:19.480
People will be angry if it doesn't rain, how will we survive?

00:29:24.450 --> 00:29:27.280
There is no rain because there is no ritual

00:29:27.280 --> 00:29:29.660
We need to carry out the ritual until he goes

00:29:34.690 --> 00:29:36.940
Man can't move the heavens

00:29:37.580 --> 00:29:39.530
You just have to get them to do it.

00:29:52.060 --> 00:29:54.950
4th Prince Wang So, born in the year of the rooster

00:30:03.040 --> 00:30:04.420
Chi Mon!

00:30:28.620 --> 00:30:31.180
4th Prince Wang So

00:30:33.310 --> 00:30:34.320
What?

00:30:39.360 --> 00:30:41.480
This is the will of Heaven

00:30:42.100 --> 00:30:44.250
You will lead the ritual

00:30:47.140 --> 00:30:48.690
I'll do as you wish

00:30:55.270 --> 00:30:57.370
Does it make sense that I was chosen?

00:30:59.370 --> 00:31:01.500
I guess Heaven deemed it necessary

00:31:01.500 --> 00:31:04.870
What are you worried about? Heaven has chosen you

00:31:04.870 --> 00:31:07.000
Doubting yourself is bad

00:31:09.880 --> 00:31:12.980
Yes I was chosen

00:31:45.520 --> 00:31:47.310
- 4th prince?
- This is him

00:32:02.550 --> 00:32:04.640
How is this possible?

00:32:05.920 --> 00:32:07.730
Why him?

00:32:10.000 --> 00:32:13.180
How can a ritual be led by a masked man?!

00:32:13.180 --> 00:32:15.850
What if he angers Heaven?

00:32:15.850 --> 00:32:18.440
This is a monster, not a man!

00:32:18.440 --> 00:32:20.540
God this is a bad sign

00:32:20.540 --> 00:32:22.290
God, this is bad

00:32:22.290 --> 00:32:24.650
We need someone who will make it rain!

00:33:03.920 --> 00:33:06.400
Give us someone who can make it rain!

00:33:06.400 --> 00:33:09.790
Your Majesty, do you not consider us?

00:33:36.970 --> 00:33:39.360
Let us through!

00:33:39.860 --> 00:33:40.990
Your Majesty!

00:33:40.990 --> 00:33:43.580
Why are you doing this to us?

00:33:47.360 --> 00:33:50.360
Emperor, have you turned your back on us?

00:35:03.150 --> 00:35:06.320
I told you that opportunity will come if you wait for it.

00:35:07.290 --> 00:35:11.710
This ritual is a great time
to change the crown prince

00:35:11.710 --> 00:35:13.190
Don't miss this opportunity

00:35:13.190 --> 00:35:16.420
I've already sent thieves to stop the crown prince on his way home

00:35:16.420 --> 00:35:18.590
It will be difficult for him to return

00:35:19.760 --> 00:35:23.550
So won't blink an eye if he wants to kill

00:35:23.550 --> 00:35:26.330
But he falls to pieces when you mention his face

00:35:28.660 --> 00:35:32.280
I think he's the one Heaven turned away from

00:35:32.650 --> 00:35:35.260
Why did they choose him when I had such plans for him?

00:35:35.930 --> 00:35:40.500
I myself am surprised what the emperor and Choi Chi Mon were thinking when they chose him

00:35:40.500 --> 00:35:41.660
Have you chosen?

00:35:42.080 --> 00:35:44.340
How could they know who to choose?

00:35:45.120 --> 00:35:48.060
Do you believe that Heaven rules people?

00:35:49.910 --> 00:35:51.800
It's all nonsense

00:35:51.800 --> 00:35:54.110
People rule Heaven

00:35:54.110 --> 00:35:55.570
It's the same with ritual.

00:35:55.570 --> 00:35:59.320
Whoever leads it will be able to carry it out until it rains

00:36:03.340 --> 00:36:08.010
This time I have to see you take over Goryeo

00:36:09.540 --> 00:36:10.900
Can you do it?

00:36:46.000 --> 00:36:47.260
Prince!

00:36:49.760 --> 00:36:50.970
Prince?

00:36:57.330 --> 00:36:59.960
When did he bring this here?

00:37:07.370 --> 00:37:08.650
Are you sleeping?

00:37:42.340 --> 00:37:44.870
What are you thinking, hiding here?

00:37:46.100 --> 00:37:49.520
It's time for you to go, everyone is probably worried

00:37:50.890 --> 00:37:52.300
I don't want to bother them

00:37:53.300 --> 00:37:56.050
Don't hold on to what happened

00:37:56.620 --> 00:37:58.550
Everyone is trying to eat and survive

00:37:58.550 --> 00:37:59.560
Soon they will forget everything

00:37:59.560 --> 00:38:01.660
I said I don't need your pity

00:38:04.950 --> 00:38:08.370
Do you know the reason why you were born?

00:38:09.060 --> 00:38:10.090
What?

00:38:10.090 --> 00:38:14.140
How long must you live in this world?

00:38:14.140 --> 00:38:15.680
Have you tried to find out?

00:38:16.120 --> 00:38:17.280
I tried

00:38:18.410 --> 00:38:20.750
I've been thinking about this for the last few days

00:38:26.110 --> 00:38:27.200
Really?

00:38:28.690 --> 00:38:32.000
But... I didn’t find the answer

00:38:32.940 --> 00:38:35.880
I wasn't born this way because I wanted to

00:38:36.610 --> 00:38:38.950
I will decide how I want to live

00:38:40.880 --> 00:38:44.190
I can live a happy life, I can live a sad life too

00:38:44.190 --> 00:38:47.060
I don't want to live under the control of others

00:38:47.980 --> 00:38:49.580
So I decided for myself

00:38:52.420 --> 00:38:55.950
Life is not easy for anyone in this life.

00:38:56.880 --> 00:38:58.520
You just don't notice

00:38:59.730 --> 00:39:01.120
everyone has a hard time

00:39:06.560 --> 00:39:09.120
The ritual will begin soon

00:39:09.120 --> 00:39:13.010
What you've been through will soon be forgotten

00:39:13.440 --> 00:39:14.660
So it will be

00:39:15.960 --> 00:39:18.870
You are young, but you pretend that you know everything about the world

00:39:20.010 --> 00:39:21.260
This gets boring

00:39:38.150 --> 00:39:42.150
Why did he ask about this?
Did you even make me think that way?

00:40:11.250 --> 00:40:12.530
Done

00:40:13.450 --> 00:40:16.150
Looks good

00:40:18.880 --> 00:40:22.220
The rain ritual is today, but the crown prince is not yet there

00:40:22.710 --> 00:40:25.110
Something bad definitely happened

00:40:26.030 --> 00:40:27.450
Wait a little longer

00:40:29.180 --> 00:40:31.990
People will be worried if the ritual is delayed

00:40:32.550 --> 00:40:35.270
I'll get out of the palace to find the crown prince

00:40:35.270 --> 00:40:38.030
Please do everything you can to calm people down.

00:40:38.030 --> 00:40:39.640
I won't go

00:40:41.760 --> 00:40:45.100
I've had enough of it in front of people

00:40:45.100 --> 00:40:48.300
The Crown Prince will arrive and relieve you

00:40:48.300 --> 00:40:50.910
You have no problem killing people

00:40:50.910 --> 00:40:53.680
But is it because of such absurdity that you are in such a depressed state?

00:40:54.890 --> 00:40:56.250
Absurdities?

00:40:58.020 --> 00:41:00.830
You're too focused on your scar

00:41:01.350 --> 00:41:04.210
You won't be able to help the Crown Prince unless you overcome this.

00:41:04.210 --> 00:41:07.110
And never change your mother's mind

00:41:10.190 --> 00:41:14.610
So he used a trick
to choose me and humiliate me?

00:41:14.610 --> 00:41:18.780
For what? I thought I could handle everything
if you put me in this position?

00:41:18.780 --> 00:41:20.020
So?

00:41:20.820 --> 00:41:22.350
You knew everything

00:41:29.980 --> 00:41:31.950
Be more confident

00:41:31.950 --> 00:41:34.970
Then the number of stones thrown at you will decrease

00:41:35.710 --> 00:41:37.860
Have you ever been stoned before?

00:41:38.910 --> 00:41:41.030
"The Will of Heaven"? Bullshit

00:41:41.870 --> 00:41:45.050
Did you think that since I have a scar, it means I have no mind?

00:41:45.900 --> 00:41:47.990
While my brothers were treated like royalty,

00:41:47.990 --> 00:41:50.690
I was treated like a butcher's son

00:41:50.690 --> 00:41:52.630
And now I lead the ritual

00:41:53.680 --> 00:41:56.510
If you want a slave who will sit there until it rains,

00:41:56.510 --> 00:41:57.700
you shouldn't have chosen me!

00:41:57.740 --> 00:42:00.710
If it rains because of this "slave", then he will become the ruler!

00:42:02.000 --> 00:42:03.610
What is the "way of Heaven"?

00:42:04.120 --> 00:42:07.240
You will be able to stand in front of the people

00:42:07.970 --> 00:42:09.800
So the crown prince sits on the throne

00:42:09.800 --> 00:42:12.570
He must stand before the people to rule them

00:42:14.080 --> 00:42:15.880
But I can only lay the foundation

00:42:16.440 --> 00:42:18.460
I can't force you

00:42:20.350 --> 00:42:21.760
I understand

00:42:22.870 --> 00:42:24.180
I understand

00:42:25.830 --> 00:42:28.450
Only your desire will take you this far

00:43:18.640 --> 00:43:20.620
Come with me quickly

00:43:20.620 --> 00:43:22.090
I'm getting ready for the ritual

00:43:22.090 --> 00:43:23.610
No time to go with you

00:43:24.370 --> 00:43:27.610
I can take this mask off of you

00:43:29.170 --> 00:43:30.170
What?

00:44:52.540 --> 00:44:53.610
you

00:44:55.640 --> 00:44:58.040
weren't you at all struck by that ugly face?

00:45:00.810 --> 00:45:02.020
Are you acting this way out of pity?

00:45:03.200 --> 00:45:06.550
How can I feel sorry for someone who always threatens to kill?

00:45:08.590 --> 00:45:10.980
Whether you have a scar or not...

00:45:11.380 --> 00:45:13.420
It doesn't matter how people perceive you

00:45:14.420 --> 00:45:16.870
The fact that you are a good person

00:45:16.870 --> 00:45:18.920
he is more important to me

00:45:38.620 --> 00:45:40.380
Not that big

00:45:41.860 --> 00:45:44.840
Living in the dark for so long because of a small scar...

00:45:45.940 --> 00:45:47.400
Is this fair?

00:45:56.150 --> 00:45:58.120
And can we really trust you?

00:46:00.840 --> 00:46:03.950
I always wondered, I doubted

00:46:10.520 --> 00:46:13.980
Every time you trust, and every time you are deceived

00:46:15.350 --> 00:46:19.420
Trusting another person is a difficult thing

00:46:19.420 --> 00:46:21.530
Then I realized it

00:46:22.700 --> 00:46:27.760
That's why I... will never betray you

00:46:28.350 --> 00:46:32.810
If you trust me, I will never change my mind

00:46:33.300 --> 00:46:34.680
I can promise

00:46:38.340 --> 00:46:42.940
You... I can trust

00:46:47.940 --> 00:46:49.180
Do what you want

00:46:52.320 --> 00:46:53.630
Now

00:46:55.620 --> 00:46:56.800
I'm yours

00:47:34.440 --> 00:47:36.250
Is there no Crown Prince yet?

00:47:38.640 --> 00:47:40.930
Wait a little longer, Your Majesty

00:47:40.940 --> 00:47:43.170
You can't wait forever

00:47:43.430 --> 00:47:47.920
If the time comes for the ritual, what will happen then?

00:47:49.120 --> 00:47:52.850
Your Majesty, why don't you put the 3rd Prince in charge?

00:47:53.700 --> 00:47:56.020
He is the eldest prince after the crown prince

00:47:56.020 --> 00:47:59.100
This is a good reason, and there will be no hard feelings

00:48:21.320 --> 00:48:24.320
No matter what you do, the crown prince will not return

00:48:26.140 --> 00:48:28.120
What do you mean?

00:48:28.120 --> 00:48:31.550
My brother has a tendency to waste opportunities

00:48:55.150 --> 00:48:58.150
Will you hear him?

00:48:58.400 --> 00:49:03.700
The same voice that is in such a hurry to confess

00:49:05.150 --> 00:49:07.600
Are you still listening?

00:49:07.600 --> 00:49:11.750
Can you hear my heart?

00:49:13.600 --> 00:49:17.870
How raindrops settled on the window

00:49:16.950 --> 00:49:18.980
Now you can open your eyes

00:49:18.550 --> 00:49:24.320
Also my mind is consumed by you

00:49:25.070 --> 00:49:26.520
Need you

00:49:27.620 --> 00:49:29.200
Need you

00:49:28.150 --> 00:49:29.700
Looks like the ritual will begin soon

00:49:30.200 --> 00:49:32.470
I miss you

00:49:43.150 --> 00:49:44.530
Do you remember?

00:49:45.150 --> 00:49:46.870
I told you that?

00:49:47.170 --> 00:49:48.760
You are mine

00:49:51.700 --> 00:49:52.760
Then,

00:49:52.760 --> 00:49:54.480
is it now?

00:49:54.480 --> 00:49:58.200
or the moment you touched my face

00:49:59.850 --> 00:50:02.590
I made a decision

00:50:02.790 --> 00:50:06.070
I'll make you mine

00:50:09.850 --> 00:50:12.030
So now get ready

00:50:13.650 --> 00:50:14.920
I never

00:50:15.920 --> 00:50:18.700
I won't let you go

00:50:18.550 --> 00:50:21.550
Will you hear him?

00:50:21.800 --> 00:50:27.100
The same voice that is in such a hurry to confess

00:50:28.550 --> 00:50:31.000
Are you still listening?

00:50:31.000 --> 00:50:35.150
Can you hear my heart?

00:50:37.000 --> 00:50:41.270
How raindrops settled on the window

00:50:41.950 --> 00:50:47.720
Also my mind is consumed by you

00:50:48.470 --> 00:50:49.920
Need you

00:50:51.020 --> 00:50:52.600
Need you

00:50:53.600 --> 00:50:55.870
I miss you

00:51:38.550 --> 00:51:39.710
What is this?

00:51:39.710 --> 00:51:41.860
I've come to take my place

00:51:45.510 --> 00:51:49.860
Only the Crown Prince and I
you have the right to sit in this place

00:51:51.570 --> 00:51:54.700
And for the beast you have courage

00:52:14.740 --> 00:52:15.790
You...

00:52:18.890 --> 00:52:20.380
Have a seat

00:52:20.840 --> 00:52:22.040
Chi Mon!

00:52:22.040 --> 00:52:25.120
The 4th Prince was chosen by Heaven

00:52:28.470 --> 00:52:29.710
Let's move out

00:52:46.510 --> 00:52:48.350
Let the rain fall!

00:52:48.350 --> 00:52:49.970
Let it rain!

00:52:50.580 --> 00:52:52.710
Give us rain!

00:52:56.630 --> 00:52:58.440
Give us rain!

00:53:03.490 --> 00:53:05.130
This is the 4th prince!

00:53:05.130 --> 00:53:07.810
What? Him again?

00:53:07.810 --> 00:53:09.830
Yes, the 4th prince again

00:53:09.830 --> 00:53:11.910
- Lord!
- What is he doing here?

00:53:11.910 --> 00:53:13.850
- I should just...
- Wait!

00:53:14.400 --> 00:53:16.020
Take a close look at it!

00:53:16.020 --> 00:53:18.240
His face looks different

00:53:18.240 --> 00:53:20.180
The scar is gone

00:53:20.180 --> 00:53:22.500
- It's true
- He disappeared

00:53:22.500 --> 00:53:23.420
The mask has disappeared

00:53:23.420 --> 00:53:25.090
They said he had maggots on his face

00:53:26.790 --> 00:53:28.780
Son of the dragon!

00:53:28.780 --> 00:53:31.600
Give us some rain!

00:53:31.600 --> 00:53:34.320
Give it some rain! Let it rain!

00:53:37.650 --> 00:53:39.850
Let it rain!

00:53:39.850 --> 00:53:42.870
- Let it rain!
- Give us rain!

00:53:42.870 --> 00:53:45.480
Let it rain!

00:53:45.480 --> 00:53:47.840
Let it rain!

00:53:55.770 --> 00:53:58.640
Let it rain!

00:54:56.190 --> 00:54:57.920
What's happened?

00:54:58.740 --> 00:55:00.690
Where is Yo?

00:55:00.690 --> 00:55:02.250
Control yourself

00:55:04.410 --> 00:55:06.900
It is much more important to complete the ritual

00:57:55.760 --> 00:57:56.760
Rain!

00:57:56.760 --> 00:57:58.590
It's raining!

00:57:59.670 --> 00:58:02.220
Rain! It's rain!

00:58:02.220 --> 00:58:04.990
Heaven heard us!

00:58:06.470 --> 00:58:07.580
Finally it started to rain

00:58:08.750 --> 00:58:10.420
It's rain!

00:58:13.120 --> 00:58:15.510
It's raining!

00:59:01.970 --> 00:59:04.800
Gwangjong?

00:59:29.850 --> 00:59:36.400
Thanks for watching with us!
Release group MANIA

00:59:29.850 --> 00:59:36.400
http://doramamania.mybb.ru
http://vk.com/doramamania

00:59:36.530 --> 00:59:39.530
Scarlet Hearts: Ryeo

00:59:39.960 --> 00:59:42.840
Show your face and become confident

00:59:42.800 --> 00:59:49.100
Another place and another time here, but I believe, you are my love

00:59:42.840 --> 00:59:44.790
How could you miss such an opportunity?

00:59:44.790 --> 00:59:47.170
You had to rip his throat out to get rid of him!

00:59:47.170 --> 00:59:48.530
Don't get in his way!

00:59:48.530 --> 00:59:50.100
Otherwise you will all die

00:59:49.100 --> 00:59:55.000
A fair wind will bring your scent, it’s so easy for me to recognize it

00:59:50.100 --> 00:59:52.750
Brothers who fight each other for their father's favor...

00:59:52.750 --> 00:59:55.700
Ever since you were a child, you have coveted what belonged to the crown prince.

00:59:55.200 --> 00:59:58.000
But I don't understand

00:59:55.800 --> 00:59:57.400
Will you kill the crown prince for me?

00:59:57.850 --> 00:59:59.200
Beware of Prince Wang So

00:59:58.000 --> 01:00:01.900
When did you settle in my heart, tell me

00:59:59.250 --> 01:00:02.000
If you can't give him your whole heart, be clearer

01:00:01.900 --> 01:00:04.400
I don't understand

01:00:02.000 --> 01:00:04.650
There must be another place where I'm needed

01:00:04.400 --> 01:00:07.400
Why is my heart beating fast?

01:00:05.300 --> 01:00:07.890
Maid from Damiwon Hae Soo. Give it to me

01:00:07.400 --> 01:00:13.500
You may suddenly pass by and not notice, have you forgotten me?

01:00:08.350 --> 01:00:09.900
I love you

01:00:09.900 --> 01:00:12.450
You are my man, you are mine! Only mine!

01:00:12.900 --> 01:00:14.450
Totally my man

01:00:13.740 --> 01:00:20.460
But until you remember me...
